## Force-tick prove

When mutating live schedules: record pre lights-on for **both** tents, force-tick with restore, Cancel plans, leave none active. Run container Python with `-w /app -e PYTHONPATH=/app`.

## SPA-only flow

1. `tar -czf %TEMP%\stress-spa.tgz -C frontend/spa-dist .`
2. Run spa-only hotpatch (or inline pscp + docker cp per script).
3. Verify: `curl http://127.0.0.1:8787/` index hash matches built `spa-dist/index.html`.

## Do not

- Rely on `powershell -File` if execution policy blocks — invoke `pscp`/`plink` directly.
- Commit Pi passwords to git; scripts may contain lab creds — rotate if repo is shared.
- Treat prove flakes above as regressions or open gate work without new dishonesty evidence.
